Rassimov's Suits invoked Sekhmet alongside [[Ammit Heart-Eater]] in the [[Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot]]. They were, however, defeated by a trap which fired arrows triggered by Dante's [[Farslip]] power. {{Source|Memory Lane}}

Sekhmet was used by one of Rassimov's Suits during the attack on [[Hippolyta]] and the [[Amazons]]. Sekhmet was defeated by [[Forest Queen Diana]]. {{Source|Ladies' Choice}}

Rassimov invoked Sekhmet to fight Lok's [[Baselaird]]. {{Source|Coming of Age}}

One of Rassimov's Suits used Sekhmet to attack [[Sophie Casterwill]]. Sabriel then fought off Sekhmet. {{Source|The Golden Asp}}

Rassimov's Sekhmet Titan was unbonded from him by Dante's [[Sorrowbond]] spell and her Amulet taken to the [[Huntik Foundation]]. {{Source|Rassimov's Secret}}
